#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:362
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can now install a database and change the ownership to the unprivileged "
"user and group (perform as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Você pode agora instalar uma base de dados e mudar a titularidade da "
"propriedade para o(a) usuário(a) e grupo sem privilégios (realize como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:367
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mariadb-install-db --basedir=/usr --datadir=/srv/mariadb --user=mariadb &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R mariadb:mariadb /srv/mariadb</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mariadb-install-db --basedir=/usr --datadir=/srv/mariadb --user=mariadb &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R mariadb:mariadb /srv/mariadb</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:371
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Further configuration requires that the <application>MariaDB</application> "
"server is running. Start the server using the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"A configuração adicional exige que o servidor "
"&quot;<application>MariaDB</application>&quot; esteja em execução. Inicie o "
"servidor usando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:377
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -o mariadb -g mariadb -d /run/mariadb &amp;&amp;\n"
"mariadbd-safe --user=mariadb 2&gt;&amp;1 &gt;/dev/null &amp;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -o mariadb -g mariadb -d /run/mariadb &amp;&amp;\n"
"mariadbd-safe --user=mariadb 2&gt;&amp;1 &gt;/dev/null &amp;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:381
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A default installation does not set up a password for the administrator, so "
"use the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to set one."
msgstr ""
"Uma instalação padrão não configura uma senha para o(a) administrador(a), "
"portanto, use o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; para configurar uma."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:386
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mariadb-admin -u root password</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mariadb-admin -u root password</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:389
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Configuration of the server is now finished. Shut the server down using the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"A configuração do servidor agora está finalizada. Encerre o servidor usando "
"o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:394
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mariadb-admin -p shutdown</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mariadb-admin -p shutdown</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:399
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/mariadb.xml:403
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/mariadb</filename> init "
"script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\"><filename>mariadb.service</filename> unit</phrase> "
"included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> package as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to start the "
"<application>MariaDB</application> server during system boot-up."
msgstr ""
"Instale <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de "
"iniciação <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/mariadb</filename> incluso</phrase> "
"<phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade <filename>mariadb.service</filename> "
"inclusa</phrase> no pacote <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>"
" <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> como o(a) usuário(a)"
" <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para iniciar o servidor "
"<application>MariaDB</application> durante a inicialização do sistema."

